{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21989","headline":"续古诗十首 五 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窈窕双鬟女，容德俱如玉。\n昼居不踰阈，夜行常秉烛。\n气如含露兰，心如贯霜竹。\n宜当备嫔御，胡爲守幽独。\n无媒不得选，年忽过三六。\n岁暮望汉宫，谁在黄金屋。\n邯郸进倡女，能唱黄花曲。\n一曲称君心，恩荣连九族。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}